{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a chekcbox trait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPickerData"},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition the root item of the picker has for accessiiblity identifier the displayed text."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Forbidden by design","level":2,"anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a read only state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in both a read only and a disabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in checkboxes using OUDSCheckboxPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the OUDSCheckboxItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional with default values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>] {","        [","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                       label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                       description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                       image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                       label: \"IPA beer\",","                                       description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                       image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                       label: \"Mineral water\",","                                       image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\"))","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [String] = [\"Choice_1\"] \/\/ or empty if nothing selected","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical by default","    OUDSCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections, checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can be vertical and have a root item with a label and a counter","    OUDSCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       placement: .verticalRooted(label, .textAndCount))","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horizontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the checkboxes are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    \/\/ Here the picker is horizontal and shows the scroll indicator","    OUDSCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","                       isReversed: true,","                       isReadOnly: true,","                       placement: .horizontal(true))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Design documentation","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading"},{"text":"Orange","level":3,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_checkboxPicker_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.14.0"}]}],"name":"Since","type":"aside"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSCheckboxPicker","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents18OUDSCheckboxPickerV","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker\/init(selections:checkboxes:placement:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpaci